    "id": "fn.left-emoji-scalar",
    "description": "Surrogate-pair emoji is one character (Excel Compatibility Version 2). Version 1 counted UTF-16 units (😀=2) and is not the calc-core default.",
    "tags": ["left", "text"],
    "notes": "Microsoft Compatibility Version 2: LEN/MID/FIND/SEARCH/REPLACE/LEFT count a surrogate pair as one character. Version 1 (legacy UTF-16) is deferred.",
    "formula": "=LEFT(\"😀abc\", 1)",
    "expected": { "text": "😀" }
  },
  {
    "id": "fn.left-emoji-after",
    "description": "Prefix through a surrogate-pair emoji is 2 characters under Version 2",
    "tags": ["left", "text"],
    "formula": "=LEFT(\"a😀b\", 2)",
    "expected": { "text": "a😀" }
  },
  {
    "id": "fn.left-emoji-len",
